<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Mining leaves zinc price unchanged.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Mining leaves zinc price unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Mining and Smelting Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it had not changed its zinc selling price of 151,000 yen per tonne following its latest review of prices.</p>
<p>Major Japanese smelters periodically review their selling prices, changing them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
</text>
